{0 Logseq Journal}

{1 Execution guide}

{{!page-journal_execution_flow}Journal execution flow}: follow startup, reads,
durable writes, synchronization and resource retirement through the existing specs.

{1 Library logseq_journal.worker_coordination}

The App/Worker coordination API is {!module-Journal_worker_coordination}.

{1 Library logseq_journal.timeline_cursor}

The App Timeline paging contract is
{!module-Journal_timeline_cursor.Timeline_cursor}. It preserves the worker's
sealed paging types; the App explicitly links its implementation.
